(7719459, 1269843, 67723, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> A beauty. Too bad that I did not look or vote on this challenge </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks! The atmosphere in this photo was so special to me. You could look at the sun through the fog and everything was so soft and surreal for a few minutes.</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: A beauty. Too bad that I did not look or vote on this challenge   Thanks! The atmosphere in this photo was so special to me. You could look at the sun through the fog and everything was so soft and surreal for a few minutes.', '2022-04-29 18:11:59.000000', NULL, 0),
